## Technology Stack

- Python
- TensorFlow / PyTorch
- PrettyMIDI
- MIDIUtil
- NumPy
- Flask (optional web interface)

## Training

To train a custom model:

```bash
python train.py
```

Training data should be placed inside the `data/` directory.

## Output

Generated MIDI files are saved to:

```text
outputs/
```

You can open them using:

- FL Studio
- Ableton Live
- Logic Pro
- Cubase
- GarageBand
- Any MIDI-compatible DAW

